  "body_html": "<div class=\"follower-sheet\" data-sheet=\"inventory\">\n<p>Quando <strong><em>ti Equipaggi</em></strong>, segna un certo numero di ◇ qui sotto, su oggetti precisi o su Indefinito.</p>\n<ul class=\"bullets\">\n<li>Per un <strong>carico leggero</strong> (<em>rapido e silenzioso</em>), segna fino a 3 ◇</li>\n<li>Per un <strong>carico normale</strong>, segna 4-6 ◇</li>\n<li>Per un <strong>carico pesante</strong> (<em>rumoroso, lento, accaldato, si stanca presto</em>), segna 7-9 ◇</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"undefined\">Indefinito</h3>\n<div class=\"fs-uses\"><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"inv-undef\"><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-0\" title=\"Segno 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-0\" aria-label=\"Segno 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-1\" title=\"Segno 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-1\" aria-label=\"Segno 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-2\" title=\"Segno 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-2\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-2\" aria-label=\"Segno 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-3\" title=\"Segno 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-3\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-3\" aria-label=\"Segno 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-4\" title=\"Segno 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-4\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-4\" aria-label=\"Segno 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-5\" title=\"Segno 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-5\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-5\" aria-label=\"Segno 6\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-6\" title=\"Segno 7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-6\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-6\" aria-label=\"Segno 7\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-7\" title=\"Segno 8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-7\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-7\" aria-label=\"Segno 8\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-8\" title=\"Segno 9\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-8\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-8\" aria-label=\"Segno 9\"></label></span></div></div>\n<p>Quando <strong><em>Hai il Necessario</em></strong>, sposta un segno da qui a un ◇ preciso qui sotto.</p>\n<h3 id=\"gear\">Equipaggiamento</h3>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-supplies-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-supplies-0\" aria-label=\"Spazio\"></span><label for=\"inv-supplies-0\"><span><strong>Scorte</strong> (4+Prosperità usi ○○○○ ○○)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-more-supplies-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-more-supplies-0\" aria-label=\"Spazio\"></span><label for=\"inv-more-supplies-0\"><span><strong>Altre scorte</strong> (4+Prosperità usi ○○○○ ○○)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-even-more-supplies-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-even-more-supplies-0\" aria-label=\"Spazio\"></span><label for=\"inv-even-more-supplies-0\"><span><strong>Ancora altre scorte</strong> (4+Prosperità usi ○○○○ ○○)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"fs-muted\"><em>Usa le scorte per Riprenderti, Accamparti o avere altri oggetti <em>piccoli</em> extra.</em></p>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-mess-kit-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-mess-kit-0\" aria-label=\"Spazio\"></span><label for=\"inv-mess-kit-0\"><span><strong>Gavetta</strong> (richiede fuoco e acqua; fa durare di più le Scorte)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-bedroll-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-bedroll-0\" aria-label=\"Spazio\"></span><label for=\"inv-bedroll-0\"><span><strong>Giaciglio</strong> (recuperi 1d6 HP extra quando ti Accampi)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-blanket-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-blanket-0\" aria-label=\"Spazio\"></span><label for=\"inv-blanket-0\"><span><strong>Coperta</strong> (<em>caldo</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-change-of-clothes-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-change-of-clothes-0\" aria-label=\"Spazio\"></span><label for=\"inv-change-of-clothes-0\"><span><strong>Cambio d'abiti</strong></span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-rope-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-rope-0\" aria-label=\"Spazio\"></span><label for=\"inv-rope-0\"><span><strong>Corda</strong>, ~25 piedi</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-shovel-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-shovel-0\" aria-label=\"Spazio\"></span><label for=\"inv-shovel-0\"><span><strong>Pala</strong></span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-sledge-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-sledge-0\" aria-label=\"Spazio\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-sledge-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-sledge-1\" aria-label=\"Spazio\"></span><label for=\"inv-sledge-0\"><span><strong>Slitta/barella/travois</strong>, arrotolabile</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-snow-shoes-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-snow-shoes-0\" aria-label=\"Spazio\"></span><label for=\"inv-snow-shoes-0\"><span><strong>Racchette da neve</strong></span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-torch-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-torch-0\" aria-label=\"Spazio\"></span><label for=\"inv-torch-0\"><span><strong>Torcia</strong> (dura ~1 ora; <em>portata</em>, <em>area</em>, <em>pericoloso</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-oil-lamp-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-oil-lamp-0\" aria-label=\"Spazio\"></span><label for=\"inv-oil-lamp-0\"><span><strong>Lampada a olio</strong> (○○○ ore, <em>vicino</em>, <em>area</em>, <em>grezzo</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-extra-oil-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-extra-oil-0\" aria-label=\"Spazio\"></span><label for=\"inv-extra-oil-0\"><span><strong>Olio extra</strong> (○○○○○ ore, per lampada/lanterna, inutile come arma)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-firewood-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-firewood-0\" aria-label=\"Spazio\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-firewood-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-firewood-1\" aria-label=\"Spazio\"></span><label for=\"inv-firewood-0\"><span><strong>Legna da ardere</strong> (basta per 1 notte intera, <em>portata</em>, <em>area</em>)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-hatchet-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-hatchet-0\" aria-label=\"Spazio\"></span><label for=\"inv-hatchet-0\"><span><strong>Accetta</strong>, ferro (<em>mano</em>, <em>da lancio</em>, x perforante)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-mallet-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-mallet-0\" aria-label=\"Spazio\"></span><label for=\"inv-mallet-0\"><span><strong>Mazzuolo</strong>, ferro e/o legno (<em>mano</em>)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-mattock-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-mattock-0\" aria-label=\"Spazio\"></span><label for=\"inv-mattock-0\"><span><strong>Piccone</strong>, ferro (<em>vicino</em>, x perforante, <em>cruento</em>, <em>scomodo</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-maul-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-maul-0\" aria-label=\"Spazio\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-maul-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-maul-1\" aria-label=\"Spazio\"></span><label for=\"inv-maul-0\"><span><strong>Maglio</strong>, ferro (<em>vicino</em>, <em>possente</em>, <em>scomodo</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-staff-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-staff-0\" aria-label=\"Spazio\"></span><label for=\"inv-staff-0\"><span><strong>Bastone</strong> (<em>vicino</em>)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-spear-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-spear-0\" aria-label=\"Spazio\"></span><label for=\"inv-spear-0\"><span><strong>Lancia</strong>, ferro (<em>vicino</em>, <em>da lancio</em>, x perforante)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-long-spear-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-long-spear-0\" aria-label=\"Spazio\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-long-spear-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-long-spear-1\" aria-label=\"Spazio\"></span><label for=\"inv-long-spear-0\"><span><strong>Lancia lunga</strong>, ferro (<em>portata</em>, x perforante)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-bow-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-bow-0\" aria-label=\"Spazio\"></span><label for=\"inv-bow-0\"><span><strong>Arco e frecce di ferro</strong> (<em>presso</em>, x perforante, ○ poche munizioni, ○ esaurite)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-extra-arrows-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-extra-arrows-0\" aria-label=\"Spazio\"></span><label for=\"inv-extra-arrows-0\"><span><strong>Frecce extra</strong> (x perforante, ○ in abbondanza, ○ poche munizioni, ○ esaurite)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-javelins-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-javelins-0\" aria-label=\"Spazio\"></span><label for=\"inv-javelins-0\"><span><strong>Giavellotti</strong>, alcuni, ferro (<em>da lancio</em>, x perforante, +1 danno, ○ esauriti)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-shield-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-shield-0\" aria-label=\"Spazio\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-shield-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-shield-1\" aria-label=\"Spazio\"></span><label for=\"inv-shield-0\"><span><strong>Scudo</strong> (+1 armatura, +1 Prontezza con 7+ per Difendere)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-thick-hides-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-thick-hides-0\" aria-label=\"Spazio\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-thick-hides-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-thick-hides-1\" aria-label=\"Spazio\"></span><label for=\"inv-thick-hides-0\"><span><strong>Pelli spesse</strong> (1 armatura, <em>caldo</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-cloak-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-cloak-0\" aria-label=\"Spazio\"></span><label for=\"inv-cloak-0\"><span><strong>Mantello</strong> (<em>caldo</em>)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"possessions-items-loot\">Possedimenti, oggetti, bottino</h3>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot0-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot0-0\" aria-label=\"Spazio\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot0\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Oggetto\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot1-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot1-0\" aria-label=\"Spazio\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot1\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Oggetto\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot2-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot2-0\" aria-label=\"Spazio\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot2\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Oggetto\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot3-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot3-0\" aria-label=\"Spazio\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot3\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Oggetto\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot4-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot4-0\" aria-label=\"Spazio\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot4\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Oggetto\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot5-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot5-0\" aria-label=\"Spazio\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot5\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Oggetto\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot6-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot6-0\" aria-label=\"Spazio\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot6\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Oggetto\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot7-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot7-0\" aria-label=\"Spazio\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot7\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Oggetto\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"other-things\">Altre cose</h3>\n<p class=\"fs-muted\">(animali, attrezzature, oggetti messi da parte, ecc.)</p>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-notes\"><textarea class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:other-things\" rows=\"2\" aria-label=\"Altre cose\"></textarea></div>\n<h3 id=\"small-items\">Oggetti piccoli</h3>\n<p>Stanno in una tasca, una borsa o uno stivale. Quando <strong><em>ti Equipaggi</em></strong>, segna ☐ qui sotto in numero pari a 4+Prosperità.</p>\n<div class=\"fs-uses\"><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"inv-small-undef\"><span class=\"track-label\">Indefinito</span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-0\" title=\"Segno 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-0\" aria-label=\"Segno 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-1\" title=\"Segno 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-1\" aria-label=\"Segno 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-2\" title=\"Segno 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-2\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-2\" aria-label=\"Segno 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-3\" title=\"Segno 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-3\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-3\" aria-label=\"Segno 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-4\" title=\"Segno 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-4\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-4\" aria-label=\"Segno 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-5\" title=\"Segno 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-5\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-5\" aria-label=\"Segno 6\"></label></span></div></div>\n<p>Quando <strong><em>Hai il Necessario</em></strong>, sposta un segno da qui agli oggetti qui sotto, oppure consuma scorte per segnare un ☐ in più.</p>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list inv-small\">\n<li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-knife\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-knife\" data-check-id=\"inv-knife\"> <span><strong>Coltello o pugnale</strong>, ferro (<em>mano</em>)</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-sling\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-sling\" data-check-id=\"inv-sling\"> <span><strong>Fionda</strong> (<em>presso</em>, <em>ricarica</em>, <em>scomodo</em>, ○ poche munizioni, ○ esaurite)</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-rushlight\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-rushlight\" data-check-id=\"inv-rushlight\"> <span><strong>Lume di giunco</strong> (dura ~15-30 minuti, <em>mano</em>, <em>grezzo</em>)</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-tinderbox\"><input type=\"che